{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Forest 6174</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A BRIEF FIRST-PERSON PSYCHOLOGICAL HORROR EXPERIENCE</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Danny, an exceptional individual. Danny is cooperative. Danny follows the rules. No matter how bad he feels, Danny is always ready to smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one day, Danny is summoned. Not for a promotion. Not for a reprimand. Just to be given a break, some time out of his routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, Danny is lost in the darkness of the forest, a place where logic crumbles and events defy reality. To find a way out, he must unravel the secret that lies deep within.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3162920/extras/sack.gif?t=1745237112\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest 6174 offers an immersive first-person experience that combines psychological and atmospheric horror.  The narrative unfolds through subtle interactions with the environment. Explore an eerie location and uncover fragments of the story as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 - 25 minutes of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric environment: Each level and the accompanying sounds are part of an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological horror: The game presents situations in which you do not know if they are real or in your head.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you pay attention you will discover some interesting details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game has a unique ending.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3162920?t=1745237112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3